      <p>Your nationality matters for Spain's Digital Nomad Visa. Some nationalities can enter visa-free and apply in Spain (fast). Others must apply at a consulate abroad (slow). Income requirements, document specifications, and processing times all vary by passport. Here's the nationality breakdown.</p>
